  "title": "商務 Email 入門",
  "titleEn": "Business Email",
  "minutes": 12,
  "summary": "看懂商務 email 的固定格式和常用句。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "商務 email 的格式",
      "body": [
        "多益和工作上最常讀到的就是 email。",
        "商務 email 有固定格式：稱呼、目的、請求、結尾。學會幾個固定句子，就能看懂大部分的 email。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "固定句型",
      "body": [
        "這些句子幾乎每封商務 email 都會出現："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "部分",
          "常見寫法",
          "中文"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "稱呼",
            "Dear Ms. Chen,",
            "親愛的陳小姐"
          ],
          [
            "目的",
            "I am writing to ask about...",
            "我寫信是想詢問…"
          ],
          [
            "請求",
            "Could you please...?",
            "可以請您…嗎？"
          ],
          [
            "感謝",
            "Thank you for your help.",
            "謝謝您的幫忙。"
          ],
          [
            "結尾",
            "Best regards,",
            "敬上"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "Ms. 用在女性（不管已婚未婚），Mr. 用在男性。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "passage",
      "title": "Email 範例",
      "en": "Dear Ms. Chen,\nI am writing to ask about the meeting next week. Could you please send me the schedule? I would also like to know the room number.\nThank you for your help.\nBest regards,\nKevin Lin",
      "zh": "親愛的陳小姐：\n我寫信是想詢問下週的會議。可以請您寄行程表給我嗎？我也想知道會議室的號碼。\n謝謝您的幫忙。\n敬上\nKevin Lin",
      "notes": [
        {
          "en": "I am writing to",
          "zh": "我寫信是為了"
        },
        {
          "en": "Could you please",
          "zh": "可以請您"
        },
        {
          "en": "I would like to know",
          "zh": "我想知道"
        },
        {
          "en": "Best regards",
          "zh": "敬上"
        }
      ],
      "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/biz-2/email.mp3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "practice",
      "title": "互動練習",
      "intro": "可以回上一步重看 email。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "b2-purpose-a",
          "group": "b2-purpose",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Kevin 寫信的目的是什麼？",
          "options": [
            "取消會議",
            "詢問下週的會議",
            "邀請陳小姐吃飯"
          ],
          "answer": "詢問下週的會議",
          "explanation": "I am writing to ask about the meeting next week. 寫信詢問下週的會議。"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-dear-a",
          "group": "b2-dear",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "email 開頭稱呼女性主管陳小姐，要怎麼寫？",
          "options": [
            "Dear Ms. Chen,",
            "Hi Chen girl,",
            "To Chen Ms.,"
          ],
          "answer": "Dear Ms. Chen,",
          "explanation": "正式稱呼：Dear ＋ Ms./Mr. ＋ 姓氏。",
          "promptSay": {
            "text": "email",
            "audio": "assets/audio/words/email.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-request-a",
          "group": "b2-request",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "禮貌地請對方寄檔案，哪一句最好？",
          "options": [
            "Send me file now.",
            "You send file?",
            "Could you please send me the file?"
          ],
          "answer": "Could you please send me the file?",
          "explanation": "Could you please…? 是最常用的禮貌請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-to-a",
          "group": "b2-to",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出適合填入空格的字",
          "options": [
            "to",
            "for",
            "at"
          ],
          "answer": "to",
          "explanation": "I am writing to ＋ 動詞原形：寫信是為了做某事。",
          "sentence": "I am writing ___ ask about your prices.",
          "zh": "我寫信是想詢問貴公司的價格。"
        }
      ],
      "similar": [
        {
          "id": "b2-purpose-b",
          "group": "b2-purpose",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Kevin 請陳小姐寄什麼？",
          "options": [
            "報告",
            "會議室鑰匙",
            "行程表"
          ],
          "answer": "行程表",
          "explanation": "Could you please send me the schedule? 請寄行程表。"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-dear-b",
          "group": "b2-dear",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "email 結尾的「敬上」常寫成？",
          "options": [
            "See you,",
            "Best regards,",
            "Hello,"
          ],
          "answer": "Best regards,",
          "explanation": "正式結尾：Best regards,",
          "promptSay": {
            "text": "email",
            "audio": "assets/audio/words/email.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-request-b",
          "group": "b2-request",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Kevin 還想知道什麼？",
          "options": [
            "會議室號碼",
            "會議的價格",
            "陳小姐的電話"
          ],
          "answer": "會議室號碼",
          "explanation": "I would also like to know the room number. 也想知道會議室號碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-to-b",
          "group": "b2-to",
          "type": "choice",
