            "thank",
            "thanking"
          ],
          "answer": "thank",
          "explanation": "Thank you for ＋ 名詞：謝謝你的…。",
          "sentence": "___ you for your help.",
          "zh": "謝謝您的幫忙。"
        }
      ]
